-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §33 היקף העסקה: up to a 100% position; no
-- more than two schools, with exceptions; 42 hours where one school is off
-- the reform; the Ministry's aim of completing positions of 80% and more;
-- and employment beyond 100% for those needed — frontal hours only, within
-- daily and weekly caps, at 100% of the hour value, with contributions by
-- the Dafna agreement.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT `31`

§ `33 היקף העסקה`

-- (א): up to 100% only (and (ד) is the exception).
@ref akn:art_33__para_a
`the position under the reform at most` MEANS 1

-- (ב)(1)–(2): no more than two schools, reform or not, save an integrating
-- teacher, a paramedical one and a teacher of a subject the personnel
-- division allowed in more than two.
@ref akn:art_33__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_33__para_b__subpara_2
GIVEN schools IS A NUMBER, `exempt under 33(ב)(2)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the number of schools is allowed` schools `exempt under 33(ב)(2)` IF
    schools AT MOST 2 OR `exempt under 33(ב)(2)`

-- (ב)(3): where one of the two schools is off the reform, all the hours
-- come to 42 at most, and every such case needs the Ministry's approval.
@ref akn:art_33__para_b__subpara_3
GIVEN `total weekly hours` IS A NUMBER, `approved by the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employment in a school off the reform is allowed` `total weekly hours` `approved by the Ministry` IF
    `total weekly hours` AT MOST 42 AND `approved by the Ministry`

-- akn:art_33__para_c akn:art_33__para_c/p2 The Ministry's statement of aim (to try to complete positions of 80% and more, subject to budget, the school's needs and its discretion, and to prefer it to hiring new teachers); a declaration, not a duty a teacher can enforce.

-- (ד): beyond 100%, for teaching employees (not principals or first
-- deputies) whom the districts' heads of teaching personnel decide, by the
-- criteria the head of teaching personnel publishes, are needed.
@ref akn:art_33__para_d
GIVEN `a principal or first deputy` IS A BOOLEAN, `found needed beyond a full position` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be employed beyond 100%` `a principal or first deputy` `found needed beyond a full position` IF
    (NOT `a principal or first deputy`) AND `found needed beyond a full position`

-- (ד)(1)–(2): the hours beyond 100% are frontal only; frontal, individual
-- and stay hours together come to 8.5 a day Sunday to Thursday, 5 on
-- Friday, and 42 a week, at most.
@ref akn:art_33__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_33__para_d__subpara_2
GIVEN `hours each day, Sunday to Friday` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the week beyond 100% keeps the caps` `hours each day, Sunday to Friday` IF
        all (GIVEN h YIELD h AT MOST 8.5) (take 5 `hours each day, Sunday to Friday`)
    AND all (GIVEN h YIELD h AT MOST 5) (drop 5 `hours each day, Sunday to Friday`)
    AND sum `hours each day, Sunday to Friday` AT MOST 42

-- (ד)(3): an hour beyond 100% is paid at 100% of the hour value, its base
-- §31(א)(1)'s and its computation §31(ב)'s.
@ref akn:art_33__para_d__subpara_3
GIVEN p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay for an hour beyond 100%` p IS
    `the hour value` (`the base under 31(א)(1)` p)

-- (ד)(4): contributions to a non-paying provident fund for a pension: the
-- employer 13⅓% (8⅓% severance and 5% benefits), the employee 5%, by the
-- agreement of 27.12.84 ("הסכם דפנה").
@ref akn:art_33__para_d__subpara_4
`the employer's severance contribution beyond 100%` MEANS 25/3 DIVIDED BY 100
`the employer's benefits contribution beyond 100%` MEANS 5%
`the employee's contribution beyond 100%` MEANS 5%

#ASSERT `the employer's severance contribution beyond 100%` PLUS `the employer's benefits contribution beyond 100%` EQUALS 40/3 DIVIDED BY 100

-- akn:art_33__para_d__subpara_5 The parties' undertaking to negotiate (under §155) a clarification of section 3.ה of the agreement of 27.12.84; no rule.

-- Five days of 8.5 hours are 42.5: the weekly cap of 42 is the one that bites.
#ASSERT NOT `the week beyond 100% keeps the caps` (LIST 8.5, 8.5, 8.5, 8.5, 8.5, 0)
#ASSERT `the week beyond 100% keeps the caps` (LIST 8.5, 8.5, 8.5, 8.5, 8, 0)
#ASSERT `the number of schools is allowed` 3 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the number of schools is allowed` 3 FALSE

`a teacher beyond 100%` MEANS
    `pay for the hour value` WITH
        `combined salary`             IS 7794
        `special-education allowance` IS 0
        `pensionable role allowances` IS 779.4
        `a special-education teacher substituting in a special-education class` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `pay for an hour beyond 100%` `a teacher beyond 100%` EQUALS 50
